abstract: >
  Analysis and plotting code for an integrated single-cell RNA-seq, Visium
  spatial transcriptomics and Geneformer in-silico perturbation study of lung
  adenocarcinoma: per-patient consensus NMF meta-programme discovery, TCGA-LUAD
  survival validation, tumour-associated neutrophil heterogeneity, cell-cell
  communication, spatial deconvolution, and a multi-endpoint candidate
  nomination cascade. Includes all analyses added during revision.
keywords:
  - lung adenocarcinoma
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - in-silico perturbation
